{"ID":"20250915195403-6jtu4cq","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250915195403-6jtu4cq","title":"UPL4-4——排除其他应用程序带来的问题","type":"doc","updated":"20250915195657"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195403-ef0llux","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250915195403-ef0llux","updated":"20250915195639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"排除其他应用程序带来的问题"}]},{"ID":"20250915195445-oqbzze5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195445-oqbzze5","updated":"20250915195523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 Unity 中进行性能调试或问题排查时，“排除其他应用程序带来的问题”指的是：\n要确保你在分析性能、内存、输入等数据时，不受到 Unity 编辑器之外的其他程序的干扰或影响"}]},{"ID":"20250915195445-7c0xs1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195445-7c0xs1d","updated":"20250915195457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可能带来影响的因素："}]},{"ID":"20250915195454-eo0gwkf","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195454-eo0gwkf","updated":"20250915195538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195538-74bwjho","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195538-74bwjho","updated":"20250915195538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195538-srxjd2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195538-srxjd2a","updated":"20250915195538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"系统资源争用带来的问题"}]},{"ID":"20250915195539-twjch40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195539-twjch40","updated":"20250915195544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其他后台应用可能会占用 CPU、GPU、内存、磁盘 IO、网络带宽等，导致\n游戏运行帧率降低、卡顿、系统调度不及时导致 Profiler 数据不准确、系统内存吃紧，但可能是别的应用程序占用的"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195538-3ggj5ok","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195538-3ggj5ok","updated":"20250915195538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195538-ic34xlq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195538-ic34xlq","updated":"20250915195549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入系统干扰"}]},{"ID":"20250915195552-e5atx38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195552-e5atx38","updated":"20250915195552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"某些应用程序可能劫持键盘或鼠标输入，导致 Unity 中输入响应迟缓，鼠标位置偏移或滞后等"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195538-rsedths","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195538-rsedths","updated":"20250915195538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195538-m35xjnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195538-m35xjnu","updated":"20250915195538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"音视频干扰"}]},{"ID":"20250915195554-y5w2zu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195554-y5w2zu7","updated":"20250915195618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其它程序播放音频可能干扰 Unity Profiler 中的音频模块，\n视频播放软件也会抢占 GPU 解码资源，影响 Profiler 中的 GPU 模块或视频模块\n部分音频设备驱动会导致 Unity 中音频播放异常"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195538-l631gis","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195538-l631gis","updated":"20250915195538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195538-6s9s5lo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195538-6s9s5lo","updated":"20250915195538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文件访问干扰"}]},{"ID":"20250915195619-fun6a8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195619-fun6a8z","updated":"20250915195628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后台杀毒软件、网盘同步软件可能访问或锁定 Unity 资源文件\n导致文件导入异常或 Profiler 中的文件访问模块显示大量非游戏内文件操作"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195538-4razka8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195538-4razka8","updated":"20250915195538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195538-b0d4eln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195538-b0d4eln","updated":"20250915195538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"远程调试或投屏干扰"}]},{"ID":"20250915195630-inzyot8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195630-inzyot8","updated":"20250915195630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用远程桌面、投屏、录屏等工具\n可能造成 GPU 占用异常、造成窗口失去焦点，影响输入测试结果\n也可能导致垂直同步和帧率异常"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195445-1vyi9oh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195445-1vyi9oh","updated":"20250915195445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250915195639-b3zg55w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250915195639-b3zg55w","updated":"20250915195657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对项目进行性能分析时的建议"}]},{"ID":"20250915195647-awd7fg9","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195647-awd7fg9","updated":"20250915195657"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195657-95ata2m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195657-95ata2m","updated":"20250915195657"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195657-10qcrs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195657-10qcrs9","updated":"20250915195700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在进行性能分析时，特别是CPU、GPU、内存相关，最好关闭一切后台应用，尤其是对这些模块有高占用的内容"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195657-bo1ubbp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195657-bo1ubbp","updated":"20250915195657"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195657-x1sfna0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195657-x1sfna0","updated":"20250915195706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在进行输入调试时，首先要确保 Game 窗口获得焦点，不要使用远程桌面"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195657-l6mee3x","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195657-l6mee3x","updated":"20250915195657"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195657-usemy05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195657-usemy05","updated":"20250915195657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在进行音频/视频分析时，建议关闭其它音视频播放程序"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195657-kztcegy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195657-kztcegy","updated":"20250915195657"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195657-vg1af0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195657-vg1af0a","updated":"20250915195657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在进行文件加载调试时，建议关闭系统的同步、备份、杀毒等软件的运行"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195657-ybp6my2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20250915195657-ybp6my2","updated":"20250915195657"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915195657-c6uhobb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195657-c6uhobb","updated":"20250915195746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为了避免 Profiler 本身消耗带来的干扰，更建议大家使用独立运行的 Profiler 进行调试，即使用 Profiler（Standalone Process）"}]},{"ID":"20250915195746-487jv7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195746-487jv7i","updated":"20250915195746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它可以降低编辑器本身的干扰、获取更稳定的数据采集、远程链接更加方便、资源消耗也更少\n特别是在正式的性能分析环节以及真机调试时，强烈推荐使用它！"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250915195647-m2stcmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915195647-m2stcmr","updated":"20250915195647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总之，在进行性能分析和调试时，一定要保持测试环境的纯净\n这样才能够准确定位游戏自身的问题，避免被其他应用程序误导，节省排查时间"}]}]}